    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katika mwaka wa pili wa enzi ya Yehoashi mwana wa Yehoahazi huko Israeli, Amazia mwana wa Yoashi mfalme wa Yuda alianza kutawala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alipoanza kutawala alikuwa na umri wa miaka ishirini na mitano, naye alitawala katika Yerusalemu kwa muda wa miaka ishirini na tisa. Mama yake aliitwa Yehoadani wa Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alitenda yaliyo mema mbele ya Mwenyezi-Mungu, lakini hakuwa kama babu yake Daudi. Bali alifanya mambo yote kama Yoashi baba yake; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "isipokuwa mahali pa ibada milimani hapakuharibiwa na watu waliendelea kutambika na kufukiza ubani mahali hapo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mara tu Amazia alipojiimarisha mamlakani, aliwaua watumishi waliomuua mfalme, baba yake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini hakuwaua watoto wa wauaji; kama ilivyoandikwa katika Kitabu cha Sheria za Mose, Mwenyezi-Mungu anapotoa amri akisema, “Wazazi hawatauawa kwa ajili ya watoto wao, wala watoto hawatauawa kwa ajili ya wazazi wao; bali kila mtu atauawa kwa ajili ya dhambi zake mwenyewe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amazia aliwaua Waedomu 10,000 katika Bonde la Chumvi; aliutwaa kwa nguvu mji wa Sela na kuuita Yoktheeli, na hivi ndivyo unavyoitwa mpaka sasa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha Amazia akatuma wajumbe kwa Yehoashi mwana wa Yehoahazi, mwana wa Yehu mfalme wa Israeli akisema, “Njoo tupambane.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini Yehoashi mfalme wa Israeli alimpelekea ujumbe Amazia mfalme wa Israeli, akisema, “Siku moja mbaruti wa Lebanoni uliuambia mwerezi, wa huko Lebanoni pia, ‘Mwoze binti yako kwa mwanangu.’ Lakini mnyama wa mwituni akapita hapo na kuukanyagakanyaga mbaruti huo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sasa wewe Amazia umewashinda kabisa Waedomu, na moyo wako unakufanya ujivune. Ridhika na utukufu wako, ukakae nyumbani; ya nini kujitafutia taabu zitakazokuangamiza wewe mwenyewe pamoja na watu wako wa Yuda?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini Amazia hakujali. Kwa hiyo Yehoashi mfalme wa Israeli alitoka akakabiliana uso kwa uso na Amazia huko vitani Beth-shemeshi, nchini Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Watu wa Yuda walishindwa na watu wa Israeli na kila mmoja alirudi kwake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoashi mfalme wa Israeli alimteka Amazia mfalme wa Yuda, mwana wa Yehoashi, mwana wa Ahazia huko Beth-shemeshi; halafu akauendea Yerusalemu na kuubomoa ukuta wake kutoka Lango la Efraimu mpaka Lango la Pembeni, umbali wa karibu mita 200. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alichukua dhahabu yote na fedha, hata na vifaa vyote vilivyokuwa katika nyumba ya Mwenyezi-Mungu na katika hazina ya ikulu; pia alichukua mateka,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14:14",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "mateka:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kiebrania “wana wa dhamana”.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kisha akarudi Samaria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Matendo mengine yote ya Yehoashi, ushujaa wake na vita alivyopigana na mfalme Amazia wa Yuda yameandikwa katika Kitabu cha Mambo ya Nyakati za Wafalme wa Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoashi alifariki, akazikwa katika makaburi ya kifalme huko Samaria. Mwanae, Yeroboamu akatawala mahali pake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amazia mwana wa Yoashi mfalme wa Yuda aliishi miaka kumi na mitano baada ya mfalme Yehoashi wa Israeli kufariki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Matendo mengine yote ya Amazia yameandikwa katika Kitabu cha Mambo ya Nyakati za Wafalme wa Yuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Njama za kumwua Amazia zilifanywa Yerusalemu, kwa hiyo alikimbilia Lakishi, lakini maadui walituma watu wa kumwua huko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maiti yake ililetwa juu ya farasi na kuzikwa katika makaburi ya kifalme katika Yerusalemu katika mji wa Daudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha watu wote wa Yuda wakamchukua Azaria",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14:21",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Azariya:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Au Uzia.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " akiwa na umri wa miaka kumi na sita, wakamtawaza mahali pa Amazia baba yake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Azaria, baada ya kifo cha baba yake, aliujenga upya mji wa Elathi na kuurudisha kwa Yuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katika mwaka wa kumi na tano wa enzi ya Amazia mwana wa Yoashi mfalme wa Yuda, Yeroboamu mwana wa Yehoashi mfalme wa Israeli alianza kutawala huko Samaria, akatawala kwa muda wa miaka arubaini na mmoja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alimwasi Mwenyezi-Mungu akafuata mfano wa mtangulizi wake mfalme Yeroboamu mwana wa Nebati, aliyewapotosha watu wa Israeli wakatenda dhambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aliikomboa nchi yote iliyokuwa mali ya Israeli, kutoka Pito la Hamathi mpaka Bahari ya Araba. Hivi ndivyo alivyoahidi Mwenyezi-Mungu kwa njia ya mtumishi wake Yona mwana wa Amitai, nabii, kutoka Gath-heferi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maana Mwenyezi-Mungu aliona taabu kubwa kwa waliyopata Waisraeli kwani hapakuwa na mtu yeyote wa kuwasaidia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini Mwenyezi-Mungu hakuwa amesema ya kwamba ataangamiza Israeli kabisa, hivyo aliwaokoa kwa njia ya mfalme Yeroboamu mwana wa Yehoashi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
